# Data Files & Scripts
# =================================
# IGNORE the entire new data directory structure. This is the most important rule.
/data/
# IGNORE old data backups.
/data_old/
# IGNORE one-off utility scripts that are not part of the core application.
/download_assets.js
# IGNORE personal notes.
/riot.txt
# IGNORE personal workspace
/workspace/

